# Security-auditor skill scratch dirs (Map-Hunt-Attack work products)
.sc-auditor-work/

# Stray Foundry fuzz cache when forge is run from the repo root (contracts/cache is already ignored)
/cache/

# Forge-installed dependencies. These are independent forge-install repos (solady, forge-std, v4-core,
# zRouter, zamm, ...), never tracked here. contracts/.gitignore already ignores `lib/` for the directory
# form, but a trailing-slash rule does NOT match a symlink — which is how a self-referential `contracts/lib`
# symlink got committed once (noesis-040). This anchored, slash-less rule ignores the path regardless of
# type (dir OR symlink), so the landmine can never re-materialize into the index.
contracts/lib

# PID file for the local anvil dev fork (app/scripts/dev-chain/fork.sh), used to verify ownership
# before a stop/restart is allowed to kill the process holding :8545.
/.anvil.pid

# Third-party bytecode, ABIs and deployment records pulled from a block explorer by
# app/scripts/sepolia-algebra (see its RUNBOOK.md). The tools are committed; their output is not —
# this repository carries deployed addresses and its own MIT interfaces, never vendored third-party
# artifacts. Everything under it is re-fetchable by re-running the fetch tool.
app/scripts/sepolia-algebra/artifacts/
